    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1394.06,
        1414.3
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1414.38,
    "end": 1466.74,
    "text": "I'm taking a sec, and I'm hoping that it's just a horrible lapse in judgment and not, like, love.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1414.38,
        1466.74
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1466.82,
    "end": 1511.6,
    "text": "And once he moves through this, we will eventually be able to be okay again.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1466.82,
        1511.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1511.7,
    "end": 1526.74,
    "text": "What do you think about that?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1511.7,
        1526.74
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1526.82,
    "end": 1543.48,
    "text": "Clearly you don't think that's a possible thing.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1526.82,
        1543.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1543.56,
    "end": 1565.68,
    "text": "It would be unusual.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1543.56,
        1565.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1565.76,
    "end": 1608.94,
    "text": "I get not everybody could do that, but everybody's not us.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1565.76,
        1608.94
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1609.02,
    "end": 1638.46,
    "text": "I have faith in us because I believe he still loves me.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1609.02,
        1638.46
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1638.54,
    "end": 1670.68,
    "text": "And, you know, we've been going through so much that...",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1638.54,
        1670.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1670.76,
    "end": 1691.68,
    "text": "God, I wish your expressions weren't so transparent.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1670.76,
        1691.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1691.76,
    "end": 1713.1,
    "text": "Some couples do survive these things, you know.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1691.76,
        1713.1
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1713.18,
    "end": 1753.9,
