    "end": 1919.08,
    "text": "I think part of me was even expecting this.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1889.84,
        1919.08
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1919.16,
    "end": 1943.26,
    "text": "Like, you know, he was the more successful one when we started out.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1919.16,
        1943.26
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1943.34,
    "end": 1953.88,
    "text": "No, I didn't know that.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1943.34,
        1953.88
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1953.96,
    "end": 1975.72,
    "text": "Yeah, he was He was a rising star.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1953.96,
        1975.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1975.8,
    "end": 1993.48,
    "text": "And he bowed out so that I could do this.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1975.8,
        1993.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1993.56,
    "end": 2007.04,
    "text": "He was amazing.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1993.56,
        2007.04
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2007.12,
    "end": 2020.24,
    "text": "It was all his idea.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2007.12,
        2020.24
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2020.32,
    "end": 2086.42,
    "text": "I'm sure that's why I'm even considering this whole CEO thing, thinking maybe someone else coming in will help me get my life back on track.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2020.32,
        2086.42
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2086.5,
    "end": 2168.74,
    "text": "Okay, that's it. I hate to be the feminist here, between the two of us, but you should be able to have a huge career and be who you are without having to accept that your husband is having an affair as some kinda payback.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2086.5,
        2168.74
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2168.82,
    "end": 2185.68,
    "text": "I mean it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2168.82,
        2185.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2185.76,
    "end": 2214.28,
    "text": "But such is life, my friend.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2185.76,
        2214.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2214.36,
    "end": 2240.08,
    "text": "Not always. And I'm not so sure I'd be so forgiving.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2214.36,
        2240.08
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2240.16,
    "end": 2267.26,
    "text": "I am not so forgiving. I'm saying that I could potentially be forgiving.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2240.16,
        2267.26
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2267.34,
    "end": 2294.86,
    "text": "But don't think that I don't feel what's going on here. It's crushing.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2267.34,
        2294.86
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2294.94,
    "end": 2298.18,
    "text": "And when I think of Paige...",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2294.94,
        2298.18
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2298.26,
    "end": 2348.32,
    "text": "Also, if we got divorced, he'd remarry Maybe not to this girl, but someone.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2298.26,
        2348.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2348.4,
    "end": 2366.56,
    "text": "And we both know I'm not easy.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2348.4,
        2366.56
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2366.64,
    "end": 2392.06,
    "text": "So I could be, like, single forever, which means that...",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2366.64,
        2392.06
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2392.14,
    "end": 2426.92,
    "text": "Forgive me, but this does keep me up in the middle of the night.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2392.14,
        2426.92
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2427.0,
    "end": 2444.2,
    "text": "That I don't wanna be buried alone.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2427.0,
        2444.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2444.28,
    "end": 2480.98,
    "text": "Paige'll be with her husband, and Matt'll b with his new family, and I will be buried with strangers.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2444.28,
        2480.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2481.06,
    "end": 2508.22,
    "text": "I will buried in the strangers singles section of the cemetery.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2481.06,
        2508.22
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2508.3,
    "end": 2527.18,
    "text": "Not that, that is a reason to stay together.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2508.3,
        2527.18
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2527.26,
    "end": 2551.54,
    "text": "But it's just, you know, a scary sidebar.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2527.26,
        2551.54
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2551.62,
    "end": 2573.32,
    "text": "Let's take that one off your plate right now.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2551.62,
        2573.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2573.4,
    "end": 2589.88,
    "text": "You can be buried with me and Molly.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2573.4,
        2589.88
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2589.96,
    "end": 2604.76,
    "text": "I happen to have space, okay?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2589.96,
        2604.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2604.84,
    "end": 2607.82,
    "text": "Thank you so much.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2604.84,
        2607.82
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2607.9,
    "end": 2622.58,
    "text": "And to think I didn't even wanna hire you.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2607.9,
        2622.58
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2622.66,
    "end": 2636.98,
    "text": "The one time I don't have my hanky.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2622.66,
        2636.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2637.06,
    "end": 2655.34,
    "text": "You wanna watch TV?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2637.06,
        2655.34
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2655.42,
    "end": 2660.02,
    "text": "Just for a few minutes?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2655.42,
        2660.02
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2660.1,
    "end": 2678.98,
    "text": "So did we like him?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2660.1,
        2678.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2679.06,
    "end": 2699.98,
    "text": "He said all the right things.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2679.06,
        2699.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2700.06,
    "end": 2725.26,
    "text": "He said that no one knows About The Fit like me.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2700.06,
        2725.26
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2725.34,
    "end": 2754.34,
    "text": "That he doesn't wanna remove the soul of the company.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2725.34,
        2754.34
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2754.42,
    "end": 2791.66,
    "text": "He said that he doesn't have a plan. He wants to watch us and see what works.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2754.42,
        2791.66
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2791.74,
    "end": 2823.16,
    "text": "He was polite and respectful and super smart.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2791.74,
        2823.16
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2823.24,
    "end": 2833.98,
    "text": "And I hired him.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2823.24,
        2833.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2834.06,
    "end": 2838.02,
    "text": "Seriously?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2834.06,
        2838.02
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2849.52,
    "end": 2888.52,
    "text": "He told me to sleep on it and that we'd talk tomorrow, but I said the job was his.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2849.52,
        2888.52
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2888.6,
    "end": 2901.24,
    "text": "We shook hands on it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2888.6,
        2901.24
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2901.32,
    "end": 2933.74,
    "text": "You know, if we disagree, he's the tiebreaker?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2901.32,
        2933.74
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2933.82,
    "end": 2939.78,
    "text": "Of course.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2933.82,
        2939.78
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2941.5,
    "end": 2975.14,
    "text": "He's the CEO.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2941.5,
        2975.14
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2975.22,
    "end": 2989.92,
    "text": "I just made mint tea.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2975.22,
        2989.92
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 2990.0,
    "end": 3028.68,
    "text": "I liked him. And, uh, I offered him the job.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        2990.0,
        3028.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3028.76,
    "end": 3041.32,
    "text": "And you're okay with it?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3028.76,
        3041.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3041.4,
    "end": 3057.34,
    "text": "I think it'll be good for us.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3041.4,
        3057.34
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3057.42,
    "end": 3091.96,
    "text": "Do we have any, like, real booze, like vodka or something?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3057.42,
        3091.96
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3092.04,
    "end": 3141.38,
    "text": "Did \"good for us\" mean About The Fit or us?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3092.04,
        3141.38
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3154.5,
    "end": 3205.42,
    "text": "I figure if someone else can call some of the shots at work, then maybe we can get back to where we were 18 months ago.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3154.5,
        3205.42
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3205.5,
    "end": 3235.98,
    "text": "They say you can't put a genie back in the bottle, but we can try, right?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3205.5,
        3235.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3236.06,
    "end": 3252.58,
    "text": "Wait, you live here?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3236.06,
        3252.58
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3252.66,
    "end": 3276.1,
    "text": "Yeah, Ben's been putting me up until I can find a place.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3252.66,
        3276.1
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3276.18,
    "end": 3295.3,
    "text": "Oh, should I let him know that you're here?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3276.18,
        3295.3
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3295.38,
    "end": 3313.38,
    "text": "I'll ring.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3295.38,
        3313.38
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3313.46,
    "end": 3334.48,
    "text": "Come on in.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3313.46,
        3334.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3334.56,
    "end": 3348.28,
    "text": "I'm just on my way to work.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3334.56,
        3348.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3348.36,
    "end": 3363.64,
    "text": "Ben's right in here.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3348.36,
        3363.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3363.72,
    "end": 3378.04,
    "text": "I'll let you two talk.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3363.72,
        3378.04
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3378.12,
    "end": 3396.94,
    "text": "You and Fiona, huh?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3378.12,
        3396.94
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3397.02,
    "end": 3408.7,
    "text": "She's a great gal.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3397.02,
        3408.7
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3408.78,
    "end": 3428.38,
    "text": "She surprised me last night. She brought over dinner.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3408.78,
        3428.38
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3428.46,
    "end": 3439.0,
    "text": "It's brand-new.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3428.46,
        3439.0
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3439.08,
    "end": 3456.76,
    "text": "Congratulations.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3439.08,
        3456.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3456.84,
    "end": 3482.98,
    "text": "So I was ready kinda early this morning, since about 4:00.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3456.84,
        3482.98
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3483.06,
    "end": 3500.38,
    "text": "And Matt and Paige left an hour ago for afield trip, so I thought I'd come by.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3483.06,
        3500.38
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3500.46,
    "end": 3516.94,
    "text": "I hope that's okay.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3500.46,
        3516.94
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3517.02,
    "end": 3552.34,
    "text": "I just wanted to say I slept on it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3517.02,
        3552.34
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3552.42,
    "end": 3581.32,
    "text": "I haven't called Townsend yet, but I still feel like it's the right thing to do.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3552.42,
        3581.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3581.4,
    "end": 3601.18,
    "text": "I didn't sleep so well myself.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3581.4,
        3601.18
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3601.26,
    "end": 3621.82,
    "text": "You remember the day I drove you to the warehouse?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3601.26,
        3621.82
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3621.9,
    "end": 3639.4,
    "text": "You were giving me the wrong directions and all that?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3621.9,
        3639.4
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3639.48,
    "end": 3653.02,
    "text": "I remember.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3639.48,
        3653.02
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3653.1,
    "end": 3693.64,
    "text": "Okay, well, I stood in the back, and I watched you show the workers how to fold and box the clothes.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3653.1,
        3693.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3693.72,
    "end": 3716.44,
    "text": "I knew then that was why ATF was a success.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3693.72,
        3716.44
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3716.52,
    "end": 3744.4,
    "text": "No one else is ever gonna have that kind of commitment to your company, Jules.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3716.52,
        3744.4
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3744.48,
    "end": 3757.66,
    "text": "To me, it's pretty simple.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3744.48,
        3757.66
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3757.74,
    "end": 3786.04,
    "text": "About The Fit needs you, and if you don't mind me saying, you need it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3757.74,
        3786.04
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3786.12,
    "end": 3814.42,
    "text": "Someone may come in with more experience than you, but they're never gonna know what you know.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3786.12,
        3814.42
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3814.5,
    "end": 3834.46,
    "text": "I never had anything like this in my life.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3814.5,
        3834.46
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3834.54,
    "end": 3849.64,
    "text": "Not many people do.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3834.54,
        3849.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3849.72,
    "end": 3875.44,
    "text": "This big, beautiful, exciting thing that you created.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3849.72,
        3875.44
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3875.52,
    "end": 3889.48,
    "text": "It's a dream, isn't it?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3875.52,
        3889.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3889.56,
    "end": 3917.02,
    "text": "And you're gonna give that up in the hopes that your husband will stop having an affair?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3889.56,
        3917.02
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3917.1,
    "end": 3929.68,
    "text": "I don't see how that adds up.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3917.1,
        3929.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3929.76,
    "end": 3952.24,
    "text": "You should feel nothing but great about what you've done.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3929.76,
        3952.24
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3952.32,
    "end": 3976.42,
    "text": "And I'd hate to see you Iet anyone take that away from you.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3952.32,
        3976.42
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3976.5,
    "end": 3998.86,
    "text": "I guess you came over here because you wanted to hear some of this.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3976.5,
        3998.86
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 3998.94,
    "end": 4035.84,
    "text": "And maybe also because you're my...",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        3998.94,
        4035.84
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 4035.92,
    "end": 4065.46,
    "text": "Well, I was gonna say intern/best friend.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        4035.92,
        4065.46
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 4065.54,
    "end": 4096.84,
    "text": "But there's no need to get all sentimental about it, even though we could potentially be buried together.",
